(Peter Snelling) writes:
>I have some questions about djinni's:
>
>Does anyone know the chances of djinni's appearing from magic lamps or
>potions?
>
>Does the blessed / cursed status of the lamp affect the chances of it 
>appearing, or just the chances of it being peaceful / granting you
>a wish?

If the lamp has a charge on it, a djinni will appear when it is
rubbed.  You may need to rub the lamp a few times (I usually give it 5
tries), but it will come out eventually.  The blessed/cursed status
affects the chance the djinni will be aggressive/peaceful/tame/
generous when it emerges.

>Do genie's only appear from glowing potions (whatever that happens to 
